[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet lid.</p><p>1. Release the retainers (1a) and remove the cover (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044997.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the upper electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428219\">B1X</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the control unit side retainers.</p><p>3. Raise the control unit.</p><p>4. Release the control unit pins from their retainers.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044998.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Lift the control unit slightly and disconnect the lower electrical\nconnections (1a, 1b, 1c, 1d, 1e).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428211\">B1A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428212\">B1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428213\">B1C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428216\">B1D</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1e</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428217\">B1E</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Recover the control unit</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044999.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the additional junction\nunit is not damaged.</p><p>Connect the lower electrical connection\nand place the control unit in position.</p><p>Do up the control unti retainers and pins.</p><p>Connect the upper electrical connection.</p><p>Close the cover and attach the retainers.</p><p>Test the electrical system.</p>"]]